*---------------------------------------------------------------
* stdio.equ -- stdio.s's cross-module constants, split out
* 2026-08-29 for the S9 REL route: stdiofl.s (stdio's other
* half), print.s and ld.s reference these, and a REL module
* cannot export an equate (Merlin-8 ENT is code labels only --
* learning:01M08WQ2HCRMDM46TQCPWXQSKN), so equates every module
* must see at assembly time live in equ files. Put by every
* manifest that puts stdio.s, right after zp.equ. `put`-only
* file: no code, no org, no dsk.
*
* LC_FREE_RW / LC_KRN_RW: the LC soft switches stdio's buffer
* path flips -- stdio.s's own header carries the naming-vs-
* address story (check_modules pins name->address per site).
* BOTH are write-ENABLING selects: only $C083 and $C08B may be
* touched tree-wide now (docs/LANGUAGE-CARD.md, check-lc).
*---------------------------------------------------------------
LC_FREE_RW  equ   $C083          ;select the process's OWN free
LC_KRN_RW   equ   $C08B          ;reselect the kernel/ProDOS-
EXIT_WRFAIL equ   1
SIOM_LINE   equ   1
SIOM_FULL   equ   2
